  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access Now Core Support 2023-2024 (2027) - Access Now Core support - Ny strategi 2024</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Access Now K&#xE4;rnst&#xF6;d 2023-2024 (2027)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access Now is seeking to strengthen human rights and democratic actors in the digital age while raising the importance of human rights, democracy and the principles of the rule of law. The intervention will contribute to more transparent and accountable democratic societies with a focus on countries in development, better enjoyment of human rights online for the most 
vulnerable and marginalized, an greater digital safety and security for actors and organisations working to uphold human rights.
To achieve the overall goal Access Now work through their four interconnected arms technology, advocacy, RightsCon and the forwarded grants.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By working with digital rights and support for vulnerable journalists and activists, Access Now aims to strengthen human rights in the digital space, and reach people living in poverty as well as human rights defenders, and other vulnerable people such as women, girls and LGBTIQ groups.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Genom att arbeta med digitala r&#xE4;ttigheter och support till utsatta journalister och aktivister vill Access Now st&#xE4;rka de m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheterna i det digitala rummet, och n&#xE5; m&#xE4;nniskor som lever i fattigdom samt m&#xE4;nniskor&#xE4;ttsf&#xF6;rsvarare, och andra utsatta som till exempel kvinnor, flickor och HBTIQ grupper.</narrative>
  </description>
